# Baked into the production build at build time (Vite only exposes VITE_-prefixed
# vars, and they're not secret -- this URL ends up visible in the shipped JS bundle
# regardless of where it's set, so committing it here is fine).
#
# "worldcup-ai-backend" was already taken on Render, so the actual deployed
# service got the suffixed URL below instead of the predicted one.
VITE_API_BASE=https://worldcup-ai-backend-ss1p.onrender.com
